// Hive carrier (GDR-0027: "drone floods from hive carriers"; GDR-0117): two brood hangars in its flanks, their mouths
// facing out to either side, twelve drones between them. Three nerve nodes feed the hangars, two stingers and two
// thrusters; it holds back and lets the drones fight. PLACEHOLDER layout (lead default, 19 Oct 2026).
(
    id: "swarm_carrier",
    name: "Hive carrier",
    summary: "A 7×6 Swarm carrier with a brood hangar in each flank: it floods the space round it with twelve drones.",
    description: "It launches its [[ship:swarm_drone|drones]] the moment it has a target and keeps its distance while they fight. Every drone dies with its [[part:brood_hangar|hangar]]: break through to a flank and half the flood goes at once. Its nerve nodes leave [[material:nerve_core|nerve cores]], its hangars [[material:resin]].",
    lore: "It does not fight. It breeds, and sends the brood.",
    tags: ["swarm", "carrier", "middle"],
    faction: "swarm",
    behavior: "swarm_carrier",
    size: (7, 6),
    parts: [
